  "description": "LIDRIB crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C87 H45 Eu1 F36 N9 O30 Tb3,6(C6 H14),3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a branched tree with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.020-4.020 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.56-113.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C87H45EuF36N9O30Tb3·3H2O·6C6H14.",
